"The length of the longest stretch of text with no repeated character, as in"
"the Longest Substring Without Repeating Characters puzzle: abcabcbb gives 3."

"The stretch runs from start to finish. Each step either takes in the character"
"at finish or, when that one is already in the stretch, lets go of the one at"
"start."
function length_of_longest_substring takes text as text, giving number
    seen is new Set
    start is 1
    finish is 1
    longest is 0
    while finish <= length text
        if seen.has text.finish
            seen.delete text.start
            start is start + 1
        else
            seen.add text.finish
            size is finish - start + 1
            longest is Math.max with longest, size
            finish is finish + 1
    return longest

print length_of_longest_substring "abcabcbb"
print length_of_longest_substring "bbbbb"
print length_of_longest_substring "pwwkew"
print length_of_longest_substring ""
